<div style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #111827;">
  <h2 style="color:#1f2937;">New Consultation Request</h2>

  <p>Dear {{lawyerName}},</p>

  <p>
    <strong>{{citizenName}}</strong>
    has submitted a consultation request. Below is the summary they provided:
  </p>

  <div
    style="background:#f9fafb;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px;border-radius:6px;margin:12px 0;color:#111827;"
  >
    {{{summary}}}
  </div>

  <p>
    <a
      href="{{loginUrl}}"
      style="display:inline-block;padding:8px 14px;background:#2563eb;color:white;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;"
    >Review Request</a>
  </p>

  <p style="color:#6b7280;margin-top:18px;">Thanks,<br />The LawRoute Team</p>

  <hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #e6e6e6;margin:18px 0;" />

  <p style="color:#9ca3af;font-size:12px;">©
    {{currentYear}}
    LawRoute. All rights reserved.</p>
</div>